WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
- Welcome back.

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:02.760
I love finding heartwarming stories

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.470
from the internet and
presenting them here.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.800
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.910
(upbeat music) (crowd cheering)

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.680
So I'm big into crafting.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.450
I'm not great at it, but I'm big into it.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.920
So this next story touches my heart.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.753
I love it so much.

00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:16.380
A North Carolina teen taught herself

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.970
to crochet in the pandemic

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.610
and it turned into a
thriving small business.

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:23.310
But it's her crochet jellyfish
that are particularly

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.040
notable. Here's why she
donates the jellyfish

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.660
to babies in the NICU.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.340
The tentacles remind the babies

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.320
of their mother's umbilical chords

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.790
which is I know, see her face.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.410
I know, it's so sweet.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.430
So let's get her in here.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:39.097
Say hi to Mindy J who watches
on WCCB Charlotte CW5.

00:00:40.255 --> 00:00:41.588
What's up Mindy?

00:00:42.599 --> 00:00:43.960
- I'm good. How are you?

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.770
- Awesome. Okay, so this
is the sweetest thing ever.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.540
How did this come about?

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.200
- So I actually started
crocheting during the pandemic

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.510
as a way to kind of get off of my phone.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:57.150
And my mama does hair,
so she had a pediatrician

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:00.420
in her chair at her salon
and she had saw this idea

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.390
on Facebook where people
were crocheting jellyfish

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.730
for babies in the NICU, and it's a way

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:09.030
for them to kind of calm down de-stress

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:12.360
and it makes their lives
a little bit easier.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.710
So she thought

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.524
that this would be a
great community service

00:01:15.524 --> 00:01:17.940
outreach project for me and
I thought it would be too.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:20.040
So I started doing it.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.040
- Oh my gosh, I just really
want you to keep talking.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.160
Like your accent is
maybe my favorite accent

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.390
that's ever been on this show.

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:29.940
My gosh, you are so cute.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.650
How many have you made?

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.113
- So I've made 65 so far
and each one takes me

00:01:35.113 --> 00:01:38.640
about an hour to an
hour and a half to make.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.320
And this project is super important

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.290
to me cause even though I
wasn't in the NICU as a baby

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.520
I've seen how stressful it is

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.950
for the families who do
have babies in the NICU.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:50.640
And I wanna help them in
like any way that I can.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.170
And one of the great
things that has came out

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:55.410
of this project is that I've
had so many people message me

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:57.503
and like ask me how I made these

00:01:57.503 --> 00:01:59.880
so that they could do it
for their community too.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.220
- Oh my gosh, I love you so much.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.140
Justin just handed me these.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.760
They are so cute.

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.380
And I'm totally taking these

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:08.730
to my little cause
they're gonna love these.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:10.050
These are so cute.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.263
It's such a special thing
you're doing for people too

00:02:12.263 --> 00:02:13.950
at a hard time for families.

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.120
So you have such a great heart.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:16.110
So does your mama.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.984
Thank you so much Mindy J I'm
liking your post right now.

00:02:18.984 --> 00:02:19.817
Right. (crowd cheering)

00:02:19.817 --> 00:02:21.369
(notification ding)

00:02:21.369 --> 00:02:22.202
